    "custom_card_y6rJwy": {
      "type": "custom-card",
      "blocks": {
        "multicard_tCVPhd": {
          "type": "multicard",
          "settings": {
            "card_title": "Affordability: A Core Principle",
            "card_body": "<p>We're driven by the belief that good health is a right, not a luxury. Our commitment to affordability means we work tirelessly to optimize our supply chain, reduce overheads, and implement efficient processes. This allows us to offer premium products at prices that are fair and friendly to your wallet. Our factory-direct model cuts out the middlemen, passing the savings on to our customers. We are proud to make wellness accessible to everyone, regardless of their financial situation.</p>",
            "card_color": "#80c9c4",
            "text_color": "#363266"
          }
        },
        "multicard_6PTnnj": {
          "type": "multicard",
          "settings": {
            "card_title": "Build Trust with Transparency",
            "card_body": "<p>Trust is the cornerstone of our relationship with you. We're committed to absolute transparency about our sourcing, manufacturing, and testing processes. Our website and product packaging provide detailed information without making any unsubstantiated claims or promises. Our priority is to never use unwanted added ingredients and fillers. Whether you’re speaking with a member of our customer service team or a licensed pharmacist, we are here to answer your questions, offer guidance, and provide the information you need to make informed choices about your health. At Bestvite, your health journey is our passion. We're honored to be a part of your wellness story and are committed to being there for you, every step of the way. Quality and value, that's the Bestvite way.</p>",
            "card_color": "#c9d646",
            "text_color": "#00582a"
          }
        },
        "multicard_Lh9GaC": {
          "type": "multicard",
          "settings": {
            "card_title": "Dedication to Quality",
            "card_body": "<p>Quality is the heartbeat of our brand. We understand that when it comes to your health, only the best will do. That's why we meticulously source the finest ingredients, backed by scientific research. Every ingredient undergoes thorough testing for purity and potency, ensuring the contents match the label's promises. Our manufacturing adheres to stringent quality standards known as GMP (Good Manufacturing Practice). We also work diligently to formulate pure products free of unwanted ingredients and fillers.</p>",
            "card_color": "#f29169",
            "text_color": "#790726"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "multicard_tCVPhd",
        "multicard_6PTnnj",
        "multicard_Lh9GaC"
      ],
