          "settings": {
            "title": "What does it take to be <strong>NSF GMP </strong>certified?",
            "text": "<p>NSF GMP certification verifies that a facility is audited annually for quality and safety, ensuring compliance with federal regulations, retailer input, and industry good manufacturing practices.</p>",
